<view class="screen">
  <view class="header"><text class="title">目标与体重趋势</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="between"><text class="heading">当前目标 · {{goal}}</text><button class="link" data-page="diet" data-mode="profile" bindtap="follow">调整目标</button></view><view wx:if="{{profile}}" class="metric">{{profile.targets.kcal}} <text>千卡 / 天</text></view><view class="fine">先观察，再调整。一天的体重变化不代表脂肪变化。</view></view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="heading">记录体重</view><picker mode="date" start="0001-01-01" value="{{date}}" end="{{today}}" data-k="date" bindchange="field"><view class="field">{{date}} ▾</view></picker><view class="fields"><label>体重 · kg<input class="field" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" data-k="weight" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如 70.5"/></label></view><view class="fine">尽量在相近条件下称重。每天一个值，修改时确认原值后再覆盖，不会立即改变饮食目标。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveWeight" loading="{{busy}}">保存体重</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="vcard"><view class="heading">相邻两周趋势</view><view class="metric-grid"><view><text class="muted">前一周 · {{result.counts[0]}} 天</text><view class="trend-number">{{result.means[0] || '—'}} <text>kg</text></view></view><view><text class="muted">最近一周 · {{result.counts[1]}} 天</text><view class="trend-number">{{result.means[1] || '—'}} <text>kg</text></view></view></view><view class="callout">{{result.reason}}</view><button wx:if="{{result.goalReached || result.reviewRequired}}" class="link" data-page="diet" data-mode="profile" bindtap="follow">重新评估阶段目标</button><button wx:if="{{result.needsAssessment}}" class="primary" bindtap="assess">确认近期情况，评估调整</button><button wx:elif="{{profile.estimate && !result.pending && !result.goalReached}}" class="link" bindtap="assess">更新当前评估反馈</button><view wx:if="{{result.recommendation}}"><view class="strong">建议从 {{result.recommendation.effectiveFrom}} 起，每日 {{result.recommendation.targets.kcal}} 千卡</view><button class="primary" bindtap="accept">接受调整</button></view><view wx:if="{{result.pending}}"><view class="strong">{{result.pending.effectiveFrom}} 起 {{result.pending.targets.kcal}} 千卡</view><button class="link" bindtap="cancel">取消待生效调整</button></view></view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="heading">执行反馈 · 主动填写</view><view class="fine">记录日期 {{date}}，无需每周提前填写；评估时可再确认近期整体情况。</view><label class="feedback-label">饮食执行<picker range="{{adherenceOptions}}" data-k="adherence" data-list="adherenceOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{adherence}} ▾</view></picker></label><label>身体感受<picker range="{{wellbeingOptions}}" data-k="wellbeing" data-list="wellbeingOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{wellbeing}} ▾</view></picker></label><view class="between"><text>经期、盐分等短期波动</text><switch checked="{{waterChange}}" data-k="waterChange" bindchange="field"/></view><button class="link wide" bindtap="saveFeedback">保存反馈</button></view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="heading">体重记录</view><view class="fields"><picker mode="date" start="0001-01-01" end="{{today}}" data-k="from" bindchange="field"><view class="field">{{from || '开始日期'}} ▾</view></picker><picker mode="date" start="0001-01-01" end="{{today}}" data-k="to" bindchange="field"><view class="field">{{to || '结束日期'}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="between"><button class="link" bindtap="filterRecords">查询</button><button class="link" bindtap="clearFilter">清除筛选</button></view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="date" class="trend-row"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.weight}} kg</text></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="fine">此范围暂无记录</view><button wx:if="{{nextOffset != null}}" class="link wide" bindtap="more">加载更早记录</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{assessmentOpen}}" class="scrim"><view class="sheet"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="between"><text class="heading">确认近期整体情况</text><button class="link" bindtap="closeAssessment">关闭</button></view><view class="fine">偶尔一次偏离不直接阻止建议。请确认近期整体执行，以及不适和短期波动是否仍存在。</view><label>近期整体执行<picker range="{{adherenceOptions}}" data-k="assessmentAdherence" data-list="adherenceOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{assessmentAdherence || '请选择'}} ▾</view></picker></label><label>当前身体感受（已缓解可选正常）<picker range="{{wellbeingOptions}}" data-k="assessmentWellbeing" data-list="wellbeingOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{assessmentWellbeing || '请选择'}} ▾</view></picker></label><label>短期波动是否仍影响体重<picker range="{{waterOptions}}" data-k="assessmentWater" data-list="waterOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{assessmentWater || '请选择'}} ▾</view></picker></label><button class="primary" bindtap="saveAssessment">确认并评估</button></view></view></view>